Anime.js is a fast, multipurpose and lightweight JavaScript animation library with a simple, yet powerful API. It works with CSS properties, SVG, DOM attributes and JavaScript Objects.

Anime.js is 100% free and is only made possible with the help of our sponsors. Help the project become sustainable by sponsoring us on GitHub Sponsors .

animate('.square', { x: 320, rotate: { from: -180 }, duration: 1250, delay: stagger(65, { from: 'center' }), ease: 'inOutQuint', loop: true, alternate: true });

An async ORM for Python and TypeScript with one Rust core. You write the schema once in Prisma syntax. The Rust core plans the SQL and runs it on PostgreSQL or SQLite. Both languages get the same queries, the same migrations and generated, typed models.

About 1.97× faster end to end than Django (async), up to 3.55×. Source: the geometric mean of 20 cases in one run on one machine, with the database round trip included (results). Method, limits and the cases where it is not faster: Benchmarks.

